<Slide style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '32px 56px 24px 56px' }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 84, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 44, background: '#3B82F6' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
            业务要一个数，要等多久
        </Text>
    </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 548, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 688, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                一次业务取数的实际路径
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 14 }} />
            {[
                ['1', '业务提出需求', '一句话描述要什么数，通常不带口径'],
                ['2', '数据同学排期', '需求进入队列，交付时间取决于人力'],
                ['3', '来回确认口径', '“销量”是订单数还是商品件数，靠口头对齐'],
                ['4', '写 SQL 取数', '同类逻辑反复重写，上次的结果无法复用'],
                ['5', '交付表格', '结果离开上下文，下次还要再问一遍'],
            ].map((row, i) => (
                <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, height: 64 }}>
                    <Box style={{
                        width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 8,
                        background: i === 0 ? '#3B82F6' : 'rgba(59,130,246,0.12)',
                        alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center',
                    }}>
                        <Text style={{
                            fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold',
                            color: i === 0 ? '#FFFFFF' : '#3B82F6',
                            fontFamily: 'Consolas',
                        }}>{row[0]}</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                            {row[1]}
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.66)', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                            {row[2]}
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            ))}
            <Box style={{ height: 18 }} />
            <Box style={{
                background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.10)',
                borderLeft: '4px solid #06B6D4',
                padding: '14px 18px',
                borderRadius: 6,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5, fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                    三步损耗落在等待、口径与复用上，交付周期由此被人为拉长。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

                <Box style={{ width: 448, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                损耗集中在三处
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 14 }} />
            {[
                ['等待', '需求排队，交付周期由人力决定；问题越急，等待成本越高。'],
                ['口径歧义', '同一个业务词在不同人手里对应不同的 SQL，结果对不上又难以定位。'],
                ['重复劳动', '相似需求每次从头对齐一遍，口径没有沉淀成可复用的资产。'],
            ].map((row, i) => (
                <Box key={i} style={{
                    background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.08)',
                    borderRadius: 8,
                    padding: '20px 20px',
                    marginBottom: 14,
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                    gap: 8,
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3B82F6', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                        {row[0]}
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.5, fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                        {row[1]}
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>
    </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.60)', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
            Text2SQL 电商数据分析 Agent
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.60)', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>02 / 12</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
